        <p class="is-marginless" style="flex-grow: 1;">Topics allows you to fully explore and drill into the individual Topical Trust Flow values that arrive at any website. domain or URL. You can check and categorise the incoming external backlinks to any site. This can help you figure out if a page classification is due to direct links coming in, or from indirect topics where the classification may be carried through from external inbound links to other pages on the same domain.</p>
        <div>
            

                
                    <a href="/reports/compare-topics?what-is-this-tool"  class="mj-btn is-multiline is-uppercase" style="margin-top: 1em;">
